WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:06.774
Wow! Who are you?

2
00:00:07.651 --> 00:00:09.836
I am a peacock.

3
00:00:10.626 --> 00:00:13.181
We are large birds.

4
00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.647
Where do you live?

5
00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:22.343
We live in India, Indonesia, and Africa.

6
00:00:23.271 --> 00:00:26.735
We live in forests and sleep in trees.

7
00:00:27.425 --> 00:00:29.387
What do you eat?

8
00:00:30.077 --> 00:00:32.591
We look for food on the ground.

9
00:00:33.404 --> 00:00:36.625
We like berries, seeds, and flowers.

10
00:00:37.793 --> 00:00:40.550
Your tail is colorful!

11
00:00:41.069 --> 00:00:44.610
Males have long feathers with eyespots.

12
00:00:45.829 --> 00:00:49.704
We spread our feathers to show them off.

13
00:00:52.422 --> 00:00:55.359
That helps us find mates.

14
00:00:56.547 --> 00:01:00.324
Do female peacocks have colorful feathers too?

15
00:01:00.863 --> 00:01:04.578
Females are called peahens, not peacocks.

16
00:01:05.247 --> 00:01:07.626
Some have brown feathers.

17
00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:12.312
But others have colorful feathers like males.

18
00:01:13.127 --> 00:01:15.637
Do you have any enemies?

19
00:01:16.548 --> 00:01:20.072
Big cats and stray dogs hunt us.

20
00:01:20.671 --> 00:01:23.528
Some animals eat our eggs.

21
00:01:24.163 --> 00:01:28.172
People love our feathers and hunt us too!

22
00:01:29.027 --> 00:01:31.412
Do peacocks sing?

23
00:01:32.264 --> 00:01:36.233
No. We make loud sounds to find mates.

24
00:01:36.733 --> 00:01:40.543
When we spot danger, we make noise too.

25
00:01:40.845 --> 00:01:43.953
That warns everyone in the forest!

26
00:01:44.654 --> 00:01:46.979
I hear others.

27
00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:51.782
I'm going to show off my feathers.

28
00:01:53.009 --> 00:01:55.528
Good-bye, Peacock!

